WEBVTT

00:06.100 --> 00:08.500
Not only did Drei attack Sybil,

00:09.340 --> 00:12.000
but Eins and Zwei have turned their backs on me, as well.

00:13.310 --> 00:15.900
They must have been overwhelmed by the Artifact.

00:18.210 --> 00:19.040
Vier,

00:20.280 --> 00:24.080
what do you intend to do once you unleash the Artifact?

00:26.990 --> 00:31.190
I wish to serve you forever, Lady Aria.

00:35.700 --> 00:38.360
Call them here.

00:39.100 --> 00:40.120
As you wish.

00:42.240 --> 00:47.540
Hey who are you thinking of now?

00:47.540 --> 00:55.470
I am thinking of you

00:58.090 --> 01:00.760
I felt it when I opened my window

01:00.760 --> 01:03.020
Ah the smell of the night

01:03.020 --> 01:05.590
Whose face did I just see

01:05.590 --> 01:07.900
In my heart?

01:07.900 --> 01:10.630
When I was

01:10.630 --> 01:12.900
Soaked by the cold rain

01:12.900 --> 01:14.570
You were the only one

01:14.570 --> 01:17.540
To reach out your hand

01:17.540 --> 01:22.380
Why are you always

01:22.380 --> 01:27.020
The one to support me

01:27.020 --> 01:29.920
Each time

01:29.920 --> 01:34.220
I fall deeper in love

01:34.220 --> 01:39.430
Hey no matter what I do I want to see you

01:39.430 --> 01:44.130
Falling in love hurts

01:44.130 --> 01:46.900
You are always the only reason

01:46.900 --> 01:49.440
I feel happiness and heartache

01:49.440 --> 01:57.310
I am thinking of you

02:00.250 --> 02:08.820
Hey I want to see you

02:12.760 --> 02:17.270
Why have you summoned us all of a sudden, Monado?

02:14.730 --> 02:18.070
The

02:14.730 --> 02:18.070
Guardian's

02:14.730 --> 02:18.070
Feelings

02:17.270 --> 02:19.830
You know it's because of your recent actions,

02:19.830 --> 02:24.100
and your treachery against me.

02:24.970 --> 02:27.240
We simply followed our orders.

02:28.180 --> 02:31.710
And because of us, the Artifacts are in your hands.

02:31.710 --> 02:32.610
Silence.

02:32.610 --> 02:33.980
Let me command you again.

02:33.980 --> 02:37.820
Do not touch the seals until the situation becomes clear.

02:38.520 --> 02:41.650
Until you prove your loyalty to me again,

02:42.520 --> 02:44.820
you are not to act.

02:45.130 --> 02:46.360
Leave.

03:01.940 --> 03:03.610
Notify headquarters.

03:04.010 --> 03:05.110
Your wish?

03:05.710 --> 03:08.020
Tell them to take Drei.

03:08.020 --> 03:10.780
He disobeyed me twice.

03:11.590 --> 03:13.320
I don't need him anymore.

03:13.890 --> 03:14.950
Yes.

03:23.230 --> 03:25.630
Ms. Fiona's absent?

03:26.030 --> 03:28.500
Haven't we done a lot of self-study lately?

03:28.500 --> 03:30.270
Maybe she's going on blind dates.

03:30.270 --> 03:31.710
That could be it!

03:32.040 --> 03:33.410
<i>Strange...</i>

03:33.410 --> 03:35.270
<i>I'm smiling.</i>

03:38.050 --> 03:42.070
<i>It's like that never happened.</i>

03:45.890 --> 03:49.890
<i>Like Ms. Fiona is her normal kind self,</i>

03:49.890 --> 03:52.360
<i>not a member of Logos.</i>

03:54.560 --> 03:58.400
<i>Like there will be no more attacks from Logos,</i>

03:58.400 --> 04:00.370
<i>no one will be hurt,</i>

04:00.370 --> 04:02.270
<i>the Artifacts won't be stolen,</i>

04:03.100 --> 04:04.600
<i>and everything will remain at peace.</i>

04:08.810 --> 04:11.050
<i>By the Tamayori's awakening,</i>

04:11.050 --> 04:13.880
<i>the guardians gain their original powers.</i>

04:14.850 --> 04:17.050
<i>I can make everyone stronger...</i>

04:18.420 --> 04:19.590
Hey.

04:19.590 --> 04:21.560
That hurt...

04:22.060 --> 04:23.420
What do you want?

04:23.420 --> 04:27.090
I thought you might be worrying about nothing again.

04:30.270 --> 04:33.100
Worrying doesn't suit you.

04:33.100 --> 04:34.170
You shouldn't do it.

04:34.170 --> 04:36.330
I'm not worried about anything.

04:40.440 --> 04:42.280
You're unbelievable.

04:42.280 --> 04:45.280
Well, fine. We need to talk at lunch.

04:45.280 --> 04:46.280
Come to the roof.

04:46.280 --> 04:47.310
What?

04:49.150 --> 04:50.590
You don't need-

04:49.820 --> 04:51.520
Tamaki!

04:52.620 --> 04:54.820
I bet he's going to propose to you!

04:54.820 --> 04:57.960
You're living in the fast lane!

04:57.960 --> 05:00.090
You're so young! Yeah, yeah!

05:00.090 --> 05:01.320
Kiyono.

05:03.300 --> 05:07.240
Onizaki doesn't usually come talk to you.

05:07.240 --> 05:11.040
Huh? You might be right...

05:11.340 --> 05:13.370
He must be up to something!

05:14.310 --> 05:16.240
What could it be?

05:16.680 --> 05:19.250
Oh, come on. Don't make that face!

05:19.250 --> 05:21.480
It's okay, it's okay.

05:42.240 --> 05:44.030
Suguru?

05:47.680 --> 05:49.270
After you.

05:50.310 --> 05:53.010
Ohmi! Tamaki!

05:55.250 --> 05:57.220
What's that face for?

05:57.220 --> 05:59.190
I told you we needed to talk.

05:59.720 --> 06:02.090
But what's Suguru doing here?

06:02.720 --> 06:05.660
Outsiders aren't allowed here.

06:06.330 --> 06:08.500
I'm an alumnus.

06:08.500 --> 06:11.230
I'm on good terms with the school.

06:13.500 --> 06:16.470
Let me begin by reporting on the situation.

06:16.470 --> 06:17.670
Yes!

06:18.840 --> 06:20.380
The seals have been broken,

06:20.380 --> 06:23.140
and three of the Artifacts have already been stolen by Logos.

06:23.880 --> 06:29.780
One of their members infiltrated
Koryo Academy, posing as a teacher.

06:30.450 --> 06:32.390
Huh? Who's that?

06:32.390 --> 06:33.860
Ms. Fiona.

06:35.060 --> 06:36.920
Wait, really?

06:43.400 --> 06:45.300
And, most likely because the seals are weakened,

06:45.300 --> 06:46.430
Don't ignore me!

06:46.430 --> 06:48.370
the gods are beginning to stir.

06:49.700 --> 06:51.970
In light of these developments,

06:51.970 --> 06:54.340
Lady Baba has a message for you.

06:55.940 --> 06:58.710
A message? What is it?

06:59.480 --> 07:03.020
Komura, Inukai, you'll form a group.

07:03.020 --> 07:06.020
Atori, Onizaki, you'll form another.

07:06.020 --> 07:07.790
Then there's me.

07:07.790 --> 07:11.390
From now on, we will operate as these three groups.

07:11.730 --> 07:15.330
Komura and Inukai, you'll patrol the seals.

07:15.330 --> 07:19.100
I will see what I can find out about the Bureau of Medicine.

07:19.430 --> 07:20.800
Understood.

07:21.340 --> 07:25.710
Atori and Onizaki, protect the Tamayori princess.

07:26.670 --> 07:28.680
With fewer seals,

07:28.680 --> 07:33.050
they're even more likely to attack the Tamayori princess,

07:33.050 --> 07:35.020
who presides over Onikirimaru.

07:36.780 --> 07:38.420
Protect her?

07:38.420 --> 07:40.790
We're already doing that.

07:40.790 --> 07:44.920
You want us to protect her twenty-four hours a day.

07:45.260 --> 07:46.120
What?!

07:46.490 --> 07:52.130
Does that mean you'll be sleeping over and sharing a roof?

07:53.070 --> 07:54.430
Does it?

07:54.970 --> 07:56.940
I hope not.

08:01.180 --> 08:02.940
It does.

08:02.940 --> 08:04.180
What?

08:04.180 --> 08:07.110
We might not look it, but we're still men!

08:07.110 --> 08:10.980
Don't point at me, Mahiro!

08:11.050 --> 08:14.090
Why are you two blushing?

08:14.090 --> 08:15.520
We're not blushing!

08:15.520 --> 08:18.390
You're the one who's acting self-conscious!

08:18.390 --> 08:19.790
That's not true!

08:18.860 --> 08:21.460
My head is starting to hurt.

08:19.790 --> 08:22.830
I don't believe this!

08:21.460 --> 08:22.830
Takuma, say something!

08:23.530 --> 08:25.200
Hold on!

08:25.200 --> 08:26.530
We're talking about me,

08:26.530 --> 08:29.370
but you haven't asked me how I feel about it!

08:29.370 --> 08:30.810
You oppose the idea?

08:30.810 --> 08:32.570
Of course I do!

08:33.040 --> 08:38.280
A young woman and men, living together...

08:38.280 --> 08:41.380
This is all too sudden. I can't do this...

08:41.380 --> 08:44.220
O-Oh, right! Mitsuru!

08:44.220 --> 08:46.590
Won't Mitsuru be inconvenienced?

08:46.590 --> 08:48.610
I already received her permission.

08:50.160 --> 08:53.900
Once we complete our assignments, we'll meet at night.

08:53.900 --> 08:55.360
Just to be safe.

08:55.360 --> 08:57.160
Huh? Everyone?

08:58.200 --> 09:00.760
Better safe than sorry.

09:01.070 --> 09:02.700
Understood.

09:06.770 --> 09:08.640
I don't know.

09:09.980 --> 09:11.740
Did you say something?

09:12.410 --> 09:15.320
Takuma and Mahiro, you don't care

09:15.320 --> 09:18.250
that this decision was made for you?

09:18.250 --> 09:22.210
Huh? I'm starting to think this isn't too bad.

09:28.230 --> 09:30.530
I get to eat Mitsuru's cooking.

09:31.400 --> 09:32.800
You're right.

09:32.800 --> 09:34.400
Oh, that?

09:34.400 --> 09:36.870
You were thinking something else, weren't you?

09:37.770 --> 09:39.330
No, I wasn't!

09:39.770 --> 09:41.300
Idiot.

09:41.840 --> 09:45.680
What? It takes one to know one!

09:57.090 --> 09:58.820
Let's start at the west seal.

09:59.930 --> 10:01.090
Oh, actually...

10:02.460 --> 10:06.630
There's something about Logos' hideout that's bothering me.

10:07.070 --> 10:08.640
I'll go with you.

10:08.640 --> 10:12.340
No, I'm the one who said
I would find them.

10:12.340 --> 10:14.470
Let me see this through.

10:16.940 --> 10:19.380
Fine. Be careful.

10:19.380 --> 10:20.510
I will.

10:35.760 --> 10:37.400
Good, good.

10:37.400 --> 10:39.370
You controlled yourself.

10:39.770 --> 10:41.200
It's just like I told you before.

10:41.200 --> 10:47.900
Our job is to watch over the two forces and see what they'll do.

10:48.440 --> 10:50.910
If you don't want to get hurt, stay back!

10:51.310 --> 10:53.510
I can't do that.

10:55.480 --> 11:01.460
It must be your destiny for you to be so interested in them.

11:01.460 --> 11:03.690
It saves us a lot of trouble.

11:03.690 --> 11:04.830
Hey!

11:04.830 --> 11:07.760
I said I would help you,

11:07.760 --> 11:09.990
but I'm not your servant.

11:10.330 --> 11:12.320
I'll do it my way.

11:13.570 --> 11:15.930
Understood, understood.

11:19.440 --> 11:21.810
He doesn't even know he's being followed.

11:21.810 --> 11:25.110
How can a guy like him call himself an Inukai?

11:26.410 --> 11:27.880
He doesn't deserve it.

11:29.880 --> 11:31.050
I'm home.

11:31.050 --> 11:32.450
Welcome back.

11:32.990 --> 11:33.990
Hey!

11:33.990 --> 11:35.550
We'll be staying here.

11:36.960 --> 11:40.330
Please use this room during your stay.

11:43.560 --> 11:45.330
That was quick!

11:52.440 --> 11:54.380
Thanks, Mitsuru.

11:54.380 --> 11:55.610
It was nothing.

11:55.110 --> 11:57.410
This must be my stuff.

11:57.410 --> 12:00.410
Don't you think you're making yourself at home too quickly?

12:00.410 --> 12:04.220
It's a shame we won't be sleeping in the same room.

12:04.220 --> 12:07.860
Wh-What? That's sexual harassment, Mahiro!

12:07.860 --> 12:10.220
I bet you move a lot in your sleep.

12:10.220 --> 12:13.220
And you! Don't speculate randomly!

12:15.600 --> 12:18.730
Mitsuru, is everyone else staying in the same room?

12:18.730 --> 12:24.370
Ah, yes. Ohmi will be using the room next door, but Shinji...

12:31.050 --> 12:32.100
Shinji?

12:33.150 --> 12:37.110
Shinji and Yuichi are staying together!

12:37.520 --> 12:38.890
I see!

12:38.890 --> 12:39.720
Yes.

12:40.960 --> 12:43.220
Mitsuru, what's for dinner?

12:43.620 --> 12:45.430
I want meat.

12:45.430 --> 12:48.260
Oh, yes. I will go make it immediately.

12:54.770 --> 12:56.430
Hey, Takuma.

12:57.670 --> 13:00.210
Don't give Mitsuru too much grief.

13:00.210 --> 13:02.340
Huh? What do you mean?

13:02.340 --> 13:04.010
You either, Tamaki.

13:04.010 --> 13:06.380
Don't just stand there, help her.

13:11.890 --> 13:13.890
I'll go get a rag.

13:13.890 --> 13:15.050
Oh, thanks!

13:15.820 --> 13:20.390
Mahiro, there's no evidence of you using these textbooks.

13:23.730 --> 13:25.430
Mahiro!

13:26.470 --> 13:27.800
Sorry, sorry.

13:27.800 --> 13:31.640
I always end up doing something else when I'm supposed to be unpacking.

13:32.610 --> 13:35.580
We'll never get this cleaned up.

13:36.210 --> 13:37.650
What are we going to do?

13:37.650 --> 13:41.640
It'll work out.
I mean, doesn't it have to?

13:51.360 --> 13:52.760
Mahiro.

13:53.060 --> 13:55.460
Do you know how Mitsuru feels?

13:55.460 --> 13:56.530
Yeah.

13:56.530 --> 13:58.470
But it's not easy.

13:58.470 --> 13:59.830
Why not?

14:00.470 --> 14:02.900
We're the five guardians.

14:02.900 --> 14:04.000
But...

14:06.540 --> 14:10.240
Mahiro, you sure do know a lot.

14:10.240 --> 14:11.140
What?

14:11.580 --> 14:15.680
About the Logos' past, about Grandma...

14:18.050 --> 14:20.280
You knew how to open the storehouse, too.

14:24.390 --> 14:26.450
How do you know all that?

14:28.000 --> 14:30.360
I heard about it from Lady Baba.

14:30.360 --> 14:31.670
From Grandma?

14:31.670 --> 14:34.000
Why would she only tell you?

14:34.000 --> 14:36.200
Has she told you anything else?

14:36.740 --> 14:40.410
Who cares what I know?

14:40.410 --> 14:41.600
Huh?

14:42.410 --> 14:45.280
I'm going to America, anyway.

14:47.080 --> 14:48.480
America?

14:50.480 --> 14:53.190
Mahiro, that again?

14:53.190 --> 14:54.590
That's right.

14:54.590 --> 14:56.560
I'm going to cross the continent on a bike.

14:57.160 --> 15:01.120
Ride along that uninterrupted, endless horizon.

15:01.730 --> 15:07.030
I'll pitch my tent on the side of some quiet road.

15:07.600 --> 15:10.830
I'll look at the stars while drinking coffee.

15:13.940 --> 15:17.040
What? Don't laugh, you guys.

15:17.040 --> 15:18.050
But...

15:18.050 --> 15:19.310
Don't worry.

15:19.310 --> 15:21.840
I'll make sure something works out.

15:22.120 --> 15:23.950
Leave it to me!

15:25.250 --> 15:29.420
And don't try to tell me I can't.

15:29.660 --> 15:32.160
I didn't say anything.

15:32.160 --> 15:33.630
This is the kind of thing that makes you petty.

15:33.630 --> 15:35.360
Shut up! Don't call me petty!

15:59.020 --> 16:02.550
If only I could awaken, everyone would be stronger.

16:02.960 --> 16:06.450
I guess that means I'm limiting everyone's power.

16:07.560 --> 16:09.050
For now...

16:33.120 --> 16:36.060
Did I just...

16:38.960 --> 16:40.990
It's okay, O-chan.

16:41.760 --> 16:44.600
Okay! I'm going to get some fresh air!

16:54.680 --> 16:57.770
Hey! Why are you being so hard on yourself?

16:58.710 --> 17:00.450
You already put everything away?

17:00.450 --> 17:03.610
We didn't bring much stuff.

17:03.950 --> 17:05.040
I see.

17:09.860 --> 17:12.850
Worrying won't do any good.

17:13.190 --> 17:14.900
I know.

17:14.900 --> 17:16.860
I know, but...

17:16.860 --> 17:18.700
I asked you when we first met,

17:18.700 --> 17:21.400
and you were told to protect some girl you didn't know

17:21.400 --> 17:24.170
because I'm the Tamayori princess.

17:24.540 --> 17:27.300
I asked if you were unhappy about it.

17:29.540 --> 17:33.840
I realize now what an inconsiderate question that was.

17:35.550 --> 17:39.390
You and Mahiro,

17:39.390 --> 17:42.390
Suguru, Yuichi and Shinji

17:42.390 --> 17:45.520
have all thought and worried about it a lot.

17:49.900 --> 17:51.230
Hey, Takuma.

17:52.570 --> 17:56.300
Have you ever thought about running away?

18:00.610 --> 18:02.370
You're the same.

18:04.140 --> 18:07.770
You were suddenly told you're the Tamayori princess.

18:08.250 --> 18:11.380
But you never ran.

18:13.550 --> 18:16.260
Even when we almost fell,

18:16.260 --> 18:19.890
you stood in front of our enemies and protected us.

18:20.730 --> 18:22.800
Do you really expect the guardians to run,

18:22.800 --> 18:24.860
when the Tamayori princess is fighting?

18:26.800 --> 18:30.000
When you asked me if I was satisfied with my situation,

18:30.000 --> 18:32.270
I told you I couldn't go against my blood.

18:33.440 --> 18:36.440
We must protect the Tamayori princess.

18:36.440 --> 18:39.080
We're bound by blood to protect you,

18:39.080 --> 18:43.240
but we don't do it because you're the Tamayori princess.

18:47.450 --> 18:49.550
We want to protect you.

18:54.230 --> 18:55.200
It's okay.

18:56.800 --> 18:59.730
I'm sure everything will get better.

19:01.340 --> 19:02.530
It's okay.

19:04.670 --> 19:06.400
Hey, you guys!

19:08.980 --> 19:10.500
What are you doing?

19:11.610 --> 19:14.240
We were just thinking we'd go meet Ohmi and the others.

19:14.680 --> 19:17.280
Yeah. They should be back soon.

19:20.990 --> 19:22.820
Wait for me.

19:22.820 --> 19:24.090
You're slow.

19:24.090 --> 19:27.190
Aren't you supposed to protect me twenty-four hours a day?

19:27.190 --> 19:28.700
Then don't be so slow.

19:28.700 --> 19:29.820
What?

19:30.660 --> 19:32.500
Tamayoribime

19:39.670 --> 19:41.340
Hey! How was it?

19:41.940 --> 19:43.380
Nothing out of the ordinary.

19:43.380 --> 19:45.210
Thanks for meeting us.

19:45.210 --> 19:46.480
Good work.

19:46.480 --> 19:49.320
Mitsuru said she'd serve us meat for dinner.

19:49.320 --> 19:51.080
That's all you eat.

19:51.080 --> 19:53.490
I like meat, too.

19:53.490 --> 19:56.360
Right? A young man's got to eat meat!

19:57.260 --> 19:59.420
Everyone's luggage arrived.

19:59.960 --> 20:02.130
This almost feels like a school trip.

20:02.130 --> 20:03.360
It really does.

20:03.360 --> 20:05.030
With all of us, together.

20:29.090 --> 20:31.490
Shinji, don't make it too cold.

20:31.760 --> 20:33.850
No, it's much too hot.

20:34.830 --> 20:36.160
What should I...

20:36.430 --> 20:38.300
Just ignore them.

20:38.300 --> 20:42.360
They've never been able to agree on the bath temperature.

20:42.940 --> 20:45.030
Long, relaxing baths are the best.

20:45.410 --> 20:48.840
A hot, quick dip is the cool thing to do.

20:48.840 --> 20:50.830
What? Did you say something?

21:00.690 --> 21:02.280
Suguru.

21:02.890 --> 21:05.760
Did you bring your own robe?

21:05.960 --> 21:06.990
Yes.

21:06.990 --> 21:08.260
What about the other four?

21:09.230 --> 21:11.220
They're still in the bath.

21:11.600 --> 21:13.830
Then let's leave these while we have the chance.

21:35.560 --> 21:37.060
They are still inside,

21:37.060 --> 21:39.090
but they should be getting out soon.

21:39.090 --> 21:40.690
I should have told you.

21:51.910 --> 21:55.910
From between the trees

21:55.910 --> 22:03.820
The evening sun spills onto this tree lined street

22:03.820 --> 22:09.320
Talking and laughing

22:09.320 --> 22:14.690
Mysteriously made me feel at ease

22:17.200 --> 22:23.540
Since the two of us met that day

22:23.540 --> 22:27.440
Through the time we have spent together

22:27.440 --> 22:37.440
This feeling has grown

22:40.890 --> 22:43.590
In order to protect you

22:43.590 --> 22:49.200
I am here right now

22:49.200 --> 22:55.070
You try to act strong

22:55.070 --> 22:59.840
But I will accept all your weaknesses

22:59.840 --> 23:02.680
No matter how small

23:02.680 --> 23:08.080
You can rely on me for anything

23:08.080 --> 23:15.390
If you trip I will catch you with these hands

23:25.270 --> 23:27.960
Are you concerned about the demon?

23:41.110 --> 23:43.550
What's wrong? Hurry up.

23:44.280 --> 23:46.840
Why are you acting so embarrassed?

23:49.260 --> 23:53.990
I'll warm you up.

23:55.060 --> 24:00.970
Next Time: The Demon's Tradition
